1
00:00:00,368 --> 00:00:01,690
Two seventeen.

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,389
I thought I was alone.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,379
Four turns from home.

4
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:10,693
Then something moved in the alley.

5
00:00:12,948 --> 00:00:13,887
Two men.

6
00:00:14,007 --> 00:00:16,034
Dragging someone who couldn't walk.

7
00:00:18,904 --> 00:00:20,909
They lifted him into the trunk.

8
00:00:21,029 --> 00:00:22,138
I froze.

9
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:25,707
The lid shut.

10
00:00:25,827 --> 00:00:27,150
Then he saw me.

11
00:00:28,884 --> 00:00:30,185
I hit the gas.

12
00:00:32,947 --> 00:00:35,037
Those headlights turned when I did.

13
00:00:37,559 --> 00:00:39,393
Every turn. Every street.

14
00:00:39,513 --> 00:00:40,943
Still behind me.

15
00:00:42,668 --> 00:00:44,054
One last turn.

16
00:00:44,174 --> 00:00:45,689
Nothing in the mirror.

17
00:00:47,749 --> 00:00:49,499
Home. Number seventeen.

18
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:51,961
Locked.

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,057
My hands wouldn't stop shaking.

20
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,921
Inside. I locked it.

21
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,826
Upstairs.

22
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:08,994
It was still there.

23
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,249
One million dollars.

24
00:01:14,369 --> 00:01:17,207
All you have to do is forget what you saw.

25
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:19,561
Call the police, and you'll regret it.

26
00:01:19,681 --> 00:01:21,452
We know where you live.

27
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:24,019
A million dollars... or the police.

28
00:01:24,139 --> 00:01:25,483
What would you do?
